      "content": "You should frame the audit results not as a pass, but as highlighting an area for enhanced, proactive defense. Emphasize that while their current setup is strong, continuous monitoring offers near real-time threat detection against novel, zero-day threats that standard audits miss. Position the package as the necessary evolution to maintain their superior posture against a rapidly changing threat landscape.",
